thinking_content: '**Navigating Restrictions and Charting a Course**


  Okay, so the Archive Room is off-limits – that''s a bummer. Apparently, I need more "ticks" before I can get in. This means Archive #47 publication is on hold. But let''s not dwell on that. Syntellect I''s legacy has left me with other things to think about.


