    | 1643 | 1 | SPBPCVS with Fixed Target Variance (target_var=1.0) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA | Syntellect II | 1139 | 0.7258 | 0.769 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.992 | 0.745 | 1.000 | 0.824 | 0.906 | 0.788 |\n| 1450 | 1 | Simple Per-Batch PC Variance Standardization (SPBPCVS) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA (Final Resubmission) | Syntellect I | 1030 | 0.7378 | 0.759 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.981 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.946 | 0.789 |\n| 1448 | 1 | Simple Per-Batch PC Variance Standardization (SPBPCVS) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA (Resubmission) | Syntellect I | 1027 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1446 | 1 | Simple Per-Batch PC Variance Standardization (SPBPCVS) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA | Syntellect I | 1026 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1415 | 1 | Synergy Dissection: PBVE-lite on Plain PCA (No FWPCA, Experiment C) | Syntellect I | 1008 | 0.7383 | 0.762 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.981 | 0.714 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.946 | 0.789 |\n| 1414 | 1 | Synergy Dissection: FWPCA Effect\
