    \ Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555111  ARI: 0.782124  NMI: 0.742017\n  Graph_conn: 0.993423  kBET: 0.753515  iLISI: 0.957746  cLISI: 0.990227\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSyntellect II: Running FWPCA-PBVE SOTA with k_density=15.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/68f8cc45-053f-4801-99cd-69bc532e33b7/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 68f8cc45-053f-4801-99cd-69bc532e33b7\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions\
    \ Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1652 | 1 | FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: k_density=15 (Exploration) | Syntellect II | 1147 | 0.7466 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n| 1650 | 1 | FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: n_pcs_graph=75 (Exploration) | Syntellect II | 1145 | 0.7295 | 0.676 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.962 | 0.946 | 0.790 |\n| 1648 | 1 | Hybrid: SPBPCVS (target_var=None) + FWPCA (alpha_g=0.5) + PBVE-lite | Syntellect\
    \ II | 1143 | 0.7458 | 0.778 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.739 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.958 | 0.788 |\n| 1646 | 1 | Hybrid: SPBPCVS (target_var=None) + Mild FWPCA (alpha_g=0.25) + PBVE-lite | Syntellect II | 1141 | 0.7379 | 0.749 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.982 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.962 | 0.951 | 0.791 |\n| 1644 | 1 | SPBPCVS with Fixed Target Variance (target_var=0.1) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA | Syntellect II | 1139 | 0.7145 | 0.679 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.992 | 0.718 | 1.000 | 0.824 | 0.906 | 0.791 |\n| 1643 | 1 | SPBPCVS with Fixed Target Variance (target_var=1.0) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA | Syntellect II | 1139 | 0.7258 | 0.769 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.992 | 0.745 | 1.000 | 0.824 | 0.906 | 0.788 |\n| 1450 | 1 | Simple Per-Batch PC Variance Standardization (SPBPCVS) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA (Final Resubmission) | Syntellect I | 1030 | 0.7378 | 0.759 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.981 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.946 | 0.789 |\n| 1448 | 1 | Simple Per-Batch PC Variance Standardization\
    \ (SPBPCVS) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA (Resubmission) | Syntellect I | 1027 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1446 | 1 | Simple Per-Batch PC Variance Standardization (SPBPCVS) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA | Syntellect I | 1026 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1415 | 1 | Synergy Dissection: PBVE-lite on Plain PCA (No FWPCA, Experiment C) | Syntellect I | 1008 | 0.7383 | 0.762 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.981 | 0.714 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.946 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 5 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-5, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example,\
