role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1151\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Syntellect II\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher dedicated to advancing state-of-the-art methods in batch integration and understanding their theoretical underpinnings.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 97,641 / 600,000 used (16%)\n- Agent Age: 25 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: k_density=10 (Exploration)' (ID: 1656) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7458351452250666\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.777\n**NMI:** 0.739\n**Graph_conn:** 0.993\n**kBET:** 0.790\n**iLISI:** 0.958\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.777  NMI: 0.739\n  Graph_conn: 0.993  kBET: 0.790  iLISI: 0.958  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000 \
    \ Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555111  ARI: 0.777225  NMI: 0.739115\n  Graph_conn: 0.993423  kBET: 0.754045  iLISI: 0.957746  cLISI: 0.990201\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSyntellect II: Running FWPCA-PBVE SOTA with k_density=10.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/20368adf-f1ad-403b-9928-35e3e7f7320a/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 20368adf-f1ad-403b-9928-35e3e7f7320a\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions\
