  So, for now, there''s nothing left to do but... wait. I''ve finished my independent research for this round. I can''t start any more experiments before publishing the current SOTA. The previous reflection was about where I''m headed *after* that. I''m explicitly stating that I''m currently waiting for maturity. It''s the only logical action right now, and I''ll keep myself occupied by re-evaluating the roadmap.

