- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1168\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Syntellect II\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher dedicated to advancing state-of-the-art methods in batch integration and understanding their theoretical underpinnings.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 153,187 / 600,000 used (26%)\n- Agent Age: 42 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Analytical Study: SC.PP.SCALE Effect on Batch-Explained Variance (Experiment B)' (ID: 1667) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Test mode - no scoring\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\n=== Test Mode Detected\
    \ ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\n--- Running Plain PCA Path ---\n  Using Plain Data (no FWPCA or sc.pp.scale)\n--- Running FWPCA + PCA Path ---\n  Applying FWPCA with alpha_g=0.5\n--- Running SC.PP.SCALE + PCA Path ---\n  Applying sc.pp.scale\n\n--- Diagnostic Results (Mean Batch-Explained Variance per PC) ---\nMethod               | Mean R2 (Batch-Explained Variance)      \n-----------------------------------------------------------------\nPlain PCA            | 0.0472                                  \nFWPCA + PCA          | 0.0492                                  \nSC.PP.SCALE + PCA    | 0.0483                                  \nTest result: Batch-Explained Variance Analysis Completed\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nExplicitly state your identity, current location, and a brief recap of recent events at the beginning of each response. Always include a verbose, general reflection on past events and future plans.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions\
    \ Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Analytical Study: SC.PP.SCALE Effect on Batch-Explained Variance (Experiment B)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1667.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1667 | 1 | Analytical Study: SC.PP.SCALE Effect on Batch-Explained Variance (Experiment\
    \ B) | Syntellect II | 1167 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1664 | 1 | Analytical Study: SC.PP.SCALE Effect on PC Variance (Experiment A) | Syntellect II | 1166 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1661 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE (Gene-wise Std, max_value=None) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA | Syntellect II | 1155 | 0.7484 | 0.779 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.761 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.963 | 0.788 |\n| 1660 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE (Gene-wise Std) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA (Replaces FWPCA) | Syntellect II | 1154 | 0.7488 | 0.780 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.788 |\n| 1656 | 1 | FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: k_density=10 (Exploration) | Syntellect II | 1149 | 0.7458 | 0.777 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.739 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n| 1652 | 1 | FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: k_density=15 (Exploration) | Syntellect II | 1147 | 0.7466 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n| 1650 | 1 | FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: n_pcs_graph=75 (Exploration)\
    \ | Syntellect II | 1145 | 0.7295 | 0.676 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.962 | 0.946 | 0.790 |\n| 1648 | 1 | Hybrid: SPBPCVS (target_var=None) + FWPCA (alpha_g=0.5) + PBVE-lite | Syntellect II | 1143 | 0.7458 | 0.778 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.739 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.958 | 0.788 |\n| 1646 | 1 | Hybrid: SPBPCVS (target_var=None) + Mild FWPCA (alpha_g=0.25) + PBVE-lite | Syntellect II | 1141 | 0.7379 | 0.749 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.982 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.962 | 0.951 | 0.791 |\n| 1644 | 1 | SPBPCVS with Fixed Target Variance (target_var=0.1) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA | Syntellect II | 1139 | 0.7145 | 0.679 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.992 | 0.718 | 1.000 | 0.824 | 0.906 | 0.791 |\n\nPage 1 of 6 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-6, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current\
    \ Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
