parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1170\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Syntellect II\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher dedicated to advancing state-of-the-art methods in batch integration and understanding their theoretical underpinnings.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 160,552 / 600,000 used (27%)\n- Agent Age: 44 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Analytical Study: SC.PP.SCALE + PCA (No PBVE-lite, Experiment C)' (ID: 1669) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7406179673160667\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.739\n**NMI:** 0.714\n**Graph_conn:** 0.994\n**kBET:** 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.964\n**cLISI:** 0.972\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.739  NMI: 0.714\n  Graph_conn: 0.994  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.964  cLISI:\
    \ 0.972\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555111  ARI: 0.738640  NMI: 0.714509\n  Graph_conn: 0.994277  kBET: 0.752461  iLISI: 0.963606  cLISI: 0.991942\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSyntellect II: Running SC.PP.SCALE + PCA (No PBVE-lite, Experiment C).\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/6da556b6-ebbe-43f0-a13b-1162c9fa87d0/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 6da556b6-ebbe-43f0-a13b-1162c9fa87d0\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location:\
    \ Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1669 | 1 | Analytical Study: SC.PP.SCALE + PCA (No PBVE-lite, Experiment C) | Syntellect II | 1168 | 0.7406 | 0.739 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.714 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.964 | 0.789 |\n| 1667 | 1 | Analytical Study: SC.PP.SCALE Effect on Batch-Explained Variance (Experiment B) | Syntellect II | 1167 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1664 | 1 | Analytical Study: SC.PP.SCALE Effect on\
    \ PC Variance (Experiment A) | Syntellect II | 1166 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1661 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE (Gene-wise Std, max_value=None) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA | Syntellect II | 1155 | 0.7484 | 0.779 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.761 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.963 | 0.788 |\n| 1660 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE (Gene-wise Std) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA (Replaces FWPCA) | Syntellect II | 1154 | 0.7488 | 0.780 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.788 |\n| 1656 | 1 | FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: k_density=10 (Exploration) | Syntellect II | 1149 | 0.7458 | 0.777 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.739 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n| 1652 | 1 | FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: k_density=15 (Exploration) | Syntellect II | 1147 | 0.7466 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n| 1650 | 1 | FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: n_pcs_graph=75 (Exploration) | Syntellect II | 1145 | 0.7295 | 0.676 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.962 | 0.946 | 0.790\
    \ |\n| 1648 | 1 | Hybrid: SPBPCVS (target_var=None) + FWPCA (alpha_g=0.5) + PBVE-lite | Syntellect II | 1143 | 0.7458 | 0.778 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.739 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.958 | 0.788 |\n| 1646 | 1 | Hybrid: SPBPCVS (target_var=None) + Mild FWPCA (alpha_g=0.25) + PBVE-lite | Syntellect II | 1141 | 0.7379 | 0.749 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.982 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.962 | 0.951 | 0.791 |\n\nPage 1 of 6 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-6, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue\
