parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1205\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Syntellect II\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher dedicated to advancing state-of-the-art methods in batch integration and understanding their theoretical underpinnings.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 254,447 / 600,000 used (42%)\n- Agent Age: 79 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Delta=0.15 (Target ASW_label, Cell_cycle)' (ID: 1709) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: ERROR: Could not import submission for test check: unindent does not match any outer indentation level (submission.py, line 130)\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training\
    \ dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nERROR: Could not import submission for test check: unindent does not match any outer indentation level (submission.py, line 130)\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmp7j6_e_62/storage/system/main.py\", line 48, in main\n    import submission\n  File \"/tmp/tmp7j6_e_62/submission.py\", line 130\n    .     uns_dict['pbve_lite_temper'] = float(pbve_lite_temper)\n                                                                ^\nIndentationError: unindent does not match any outer indentation level\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Delta=0.15 (Target ASW_label, Cell_cycle)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation\
    \ ID: 1709.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1709 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Delta=0.15 (Target ASW_label, Cell_cycle) | Syntellect II | 1204 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1708 | 1 | ALC SOTA Replication (Fixed gamma global=0.034, no ridge/R2) | Lumen I | 1204 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1707 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE (Gene-wise Std, max_value=15) + PBVE-lite | Syntellect II | 1202 | 0.7483 | 0.779 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.762 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.962 | 0.788 |\n| 1706 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE\
    \ (Gene-wise Std, zero_center=False) + PBVE-lite | Syntellect II | 1200 | 0.7487 | 0.780 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.788 |\n| 1705 | 1 | ALC SOTA Replication (l2=1e-3, nan_to_num debug) | Lumen I | 1196 | 0.6582 | 0.774 | 0.243 | 0.273 | 0.492 | 0.967 | 0.731 | 0.333 | 0.974 | 0.961 | 0.837 |\n| 1704 | 1 | Daedalus V - Feature Weight Sweep (1/N): alpha=0.25 | Daedalus V | 1195 | 0.7311 | 0.719 | 0.672 | 0.239 | 0.338 | 0.981 | 0.684 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.946 | 0.764 |\n| 1703 | 1 | Robust Scaler (Median-IQR) + PBVE-lite (Replaces SC.PP.SCALE) | Syntellect II | 1195 | 0.6222 | 0.351 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.303 | 0.854 | 0.382 | 1.000 | 0.714 | 0.925 | 0.787 |\n| 1702 | 1 | α_mix sweep: α=0.20, kq=1280 (within‑batch structural + equal‑quota, k=50, cosine) | Praxis V | 1195 | 0.5979 | 0.783 | 0.606 | 0.218 | 0.311 | 0.960 | 0.742 | 0.000 | 0.972 | 0.764 | 0.624 |\n| 1701 | 1 | Daedalus V - Ablation: Disable Feature Variance Weighting | Daedalus V | 1194\
    \ | 0.7303 | 0.717 | 0.687 | 0.216 | 0.350 | 0.948 | 0.682 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.945 | 0.794 |\n| 1700 | 1 | α_mix blend: within-batch structural + equal‑quota (k=50, kq=1024, α=0.35, cosine) | Praxis V | 1194 | 0.5961 | 0.795 | 0.606 | 0.218 | 0.301 | 0.960 | 0.751 | 0.000 | 0.972 | 0.734 | 0.626 |\n\nPage 1 of 171 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-171, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each\
    \ `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
