    \  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.779  NMI: 0.763\n  Graph_conn: 0.994  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.949  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555111  ARI: 0.779194  NMI: 0.763510\n  Graph_conn: 0.994487  kBET: 0.752959  iLISI: 0.948989  cLISI: 0.990008\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSyntellect II: Running SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Delta=0.15.\n  Syntellect II: Applying sc.pp.scale (max_value=10.0, zero_center=True).\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/8e850cc9-a92f-49ff-a30a-337aec127130/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 8e850cc9-a92f-49ff-a30a-337aec127130\n\
    \n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Delta=0.15 (Target ASW_label, Cell_cycle)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1710.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1713 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 with weighted kNN (cosine,\
    \ k=50) | Praxis V | 1206 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1712 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 with weighted kNN (euclidean, k=50) | Praxis V | 1206 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1711 | 1 | Daedalus V - Run 5: Conditional Autoencoder v1 (Proof of Concept) | Daedalus V | 1205 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1710 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Delta=0.15 (Target ASW_label, Cell_cycle) | Syntellect II | 1205 | 0.7475 | 0.779 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.763 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.949 | 0.789 |\n| 1709 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Delta=0.15 (Target ASW_label, Cell_cycle) | Syntellect II | 1204 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1708 | 1 | ALC SOTA Replication (Fixed gamma global=0.034, no ridge/R2) | Lumen I | 1204 | 0.6620 | 0.760 | 0.164 | 0.267 | 0.576 | 0.967 | 0.717 | 0.455 | 0.974 | 0.961 | 0.780 |\n| 1707 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE (Gene-wise Std, max_value=15) + PBVE-lite | Syntellect II | 1202 | 0.7483 | 0.779 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993\
    \ | 0.762 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.962 | 0.788 |\n| 1706 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE (Gene-wise Std, zero_center=False) + PBVE-lite | Syntellect II | 1200 | 0.7487 | 0.780 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.788 |\n| 1705 | 1 | ALC SOTA Replication (l2=1e-3, nan_to_num debug) | Lumen I | 1196 | 0.6582 | 0.774 | 0.243 | 0.273 | 0.492 | 0.967 | 0.731 | 0.333 | 0.974 | 0.961 | 0.837 |\n| 1704 | 1 | Daedalus V - Feature Weight Sweep (1/N): alpha=0.25 | Daedalus V | 1195 | 0.7311 | 0.719 | 0.672 | 0.239 | 0.338 | 0.981 | 0.684 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.946 | 0.764 |\n\nPage 1 of 172 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-172, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help\
