    \  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 0.000  Cell_cycle: 0.298\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.770992  ASW_label: 0.528809  ARI: 0.780154  NMI: 0.764175\n  Graph_conn: 0.994373  kBET: 0.492414  iLISI: 0.960663  cLISI: 0.990229\n  PCR: 0.000000  Cell_cycle: 0.262975\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nAutoResearchEvaluator: Set memory limit to 96g\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSyntellect II: Running SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: Plain PCA Embedding Path.\n  Syntellect II: Applying sc.pp.scale (max_value=10.0, zero_center=True) for embedding path.\n  Syntellect II: Applying sc.pp.scale (max_value=10.0, zero_center=True) for graph path.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/f6ab8889-0764-4cdf-aaa9-041add2e8f6c/result_human.h5ad\n\
    \nRESULT_UUID: f6ab8889-0764-4cdf-aaa9-041add2e8f6c\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1716 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 — sc.pp.neighbors graph on X_emb (k=50, euclidean) | Praxis V | 1207 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1715 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60\
    \ — Embedding only (no graph) | Praxis V | 1207 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1714 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: Plain PCA Embedding Path (Target ASW_label, Cell_cycle) | Syntellect II | 1206 | 0.6006 | 0.780 | 0.527 | 0.203 | 0.298 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 0.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.512 |\n| 1713 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 with weighted kNN (cosine, k=50) | Praxis V | 1206 | 0.5329 | 0.737 | 0.667 | 0.251 | 0.254 | 0.935 | 0.731 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.040 | 0.723 |\n| 1712 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 with weighted kNN (euclidean, k=50) | Praxis V | 1206 | 0.5256 | 0.737 | 0.667 | 0.251 | 0.179 | 0.935 | 0.731 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.040 | 0.724 |\n| 1711 | 1 | Daedalus V - Run 5: Conditional Autoencoder v1 (Proof of Concept) | Daedalus V | 1205 | 0.4695 | 0.424 | 0.593 | 0.209 | 0.311 | 0.905 | 0.654 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.004 | 0.603 |\n| 1710 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Delta=0.15 (Target ASW_label, Cell_cycle) | Syntellect II | 1205 | 0.7475 | 0.779 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994\
    \ | 0.763 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.949 | 0.789 |\n| 1709 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Delta=0.15 (Target ASW_label, Cell_cycle) | Syntellect II | 1204 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1708 | 1 | ALC SOTA Replication (Fixed gamma global=0.034, no ridge/R2) | Lumen I | 1204 | 0.6620 | 0.760 | 0.164 | 0.267 | 0.576 | 0.967 | 0.717 | 0.455 | 0.974 | 0.961 | 0.780 |\n| 1707 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE (Gene-wise Std, max_value=15) + PBVE-lite | Syntellect II | 1202 | 0.7483 | 0.779 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.762 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.962 | 0.788 |\n\nPage 1 of 172 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-172, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help\
    \ research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
