    \ PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555111  ARI: 0.778551  NMI: 0.763054\n  Graph_conn: 0.995438  kBET: 0.753189  iLISI: 0.962282  cLISI: 0.989620\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSyntellect II: Running SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB k_total=55.\n  Syntellect II: Applying sc.pp.scale (max_value=10.0, zero_center=True) for graph path.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/95fd224b-a901-44c7-8f05-db9663fa7194/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 95fd224b-a901-44c7-8f05-db9663fa7194\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the\
