    \ Re-run) | Daedalus V | 1207 | 0.4694 | 0.424 | 0.593 | 0.209 | 0.311 | 0.905 | 0.654 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.004 | 0.602 |\n| 1717 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB k_total=55 (Graph Density Tuning) | Syntellect II | 1207 | 0.7487 | 0.779 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.995 | 0.763 | 1.000 | 0.964 | 0.962 | 0.789 |\n| 1716 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 — sc.pp.neighbors graph on X_emb (k=50, euclidean) | Praxis V | 1207 | 0.5352 | 0.752 | 0.667 | 0.251 | 0.205 | 0.963 | 0.744 | 0.000 | 0.983 | 0.063 | 0.724 |\n| 1715 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 — Embedding only (no graph) | Praxis V | 1207 | 0.5283 | 0.737 | 0.667 | 0.251 | 0.205 | 0.935 | 0.731 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.040 | 0.725 |\n| 1714 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: Plain PCA Embedding Path (Target ASW_label, Cell_cycle) | Syntellect II | 1206 | 0.6006 | 0.780 | 0.527 | 0.203 | 0.298 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 0.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.512 |\n| 1713 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 with weighted kNN (cosine, k=50) | Praxis V | 1206 | 0.5329 | 0.737 | 0.667\
