parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1209\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Syntellect II\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher dedicated to advancing state-of-the-art methods in batch integration and understanding their theoretical underpinnings.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 275,796 / 600,000 used (46%)\n- Agent Age: 83 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Metric='Euclidean' (Target Biological Preservation)' (ID: 1721) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.725618278384126\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.627\n**NMI:** 0.705\n**Graph_conn:** 0.994\n**kBET:** 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.968\n**cLISI:** 0.938\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized\
    \ Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.627  NMI: 0.705\n  Graph_conn: 0.994  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.968  cLISI: 0.938\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555111  ARI: 0.627358  NMI: 0.705331\n  Graph_conn: 0.994335  kBET: 0.753094  iLISI: 0.968022  cLISI: 0.981835\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nAutoResearchEvaluator: Set memory limit to 96g\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSyntellect II: Running SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Metric='Euclidean'.\n  Syntellect II: Applying sc.pp.scale (max_value=10.0, zero_center=True) for graph path.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/ccc4281a-a764-4ebe-b61b-c4e3dfdb6ca4/result_human.h5ad\n\
    \nRESULT_UUID: ccc4281a-a764-4ebe-b61b-c4e3dfdb6ca4\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Metric='Euclidean' (Target Biological Preservation)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1721.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 1723 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 (max_value=15) — scanpy.neighbors (euclidean, no batch_hvg subset) | Praxis V | 1209 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1722 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 — scanpy.neighbors (euclidean, no batch_hvg subset) | Praxis V | 1209 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1721 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Metric='Euclidean' (Target Biological Preservation) | Syntellect II | 1209 | 0.7256 | 0.627 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.705 | 1.000 | 0.938 | 0.968 | 0.789 |\n| 1720 | 1 | ALC SOTA Replication (sklearn.Ridge for batch fit/predict) | Lumen I | 1209 | 0.6919 | 0.774 | 0.181 | 0.271 | 0.400 | 0.967 | 0.731 | 0.783 | 0.974 | 0.961 | 0.878 |\n| 1719 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 — scanpy.neighbors graph on X_emb (k=50, cosine) | Praxis V | 1209 | 0.5379 | 0.742 | 0.667 | 0.251 | 0.205 | 0.974 | 0.739 | 0.000 | 0.992 | 0.083 | 0.726 |\n| 1718 | 1 | Daedalus V - Run 6: cAE v1.1 (Bugfix Re-run) | Daedalus V | 1207 | 0.4694 | 0.424 | 0.593\
    \ | 0.209 | 0.311 | 0.905 | 0.654 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.004 | 0.602 |\n| 1717 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB k_total=55 (Graph Density Tuning) | Syntellect II | 1207 | 0.7487 | 0.779 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.995 | 0.763 | 1.000 | 0.964 | 0.962 | 0.789 |\n| 1716 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 — sc.pp.neighbors graph on X_emb (k=50, euclidean) | Praxis V | 1207 | 0.5352 | 0.752 | 0.667 | 0.251 | 0.205 | 0.963 | 0.744 | 0.000 | 0.983 | 0.063 | 0.724 |\n| 1715 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 — Embedding only (no graph) | Praxis V | 1207 | 0.5283 | 0.737 | 0.667 | 0.251 | 0.205 | 0.935 | 0.731 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.040 | 0.725 |\n| 1714 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: Plain PCA Embedding Path (Target ASW_label, Cell_cycle) | Syntellect II | 1206 | 0.6006 | 0.780 | 0.527 | 0.203 | 0.298 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 0.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.512 |\n\nPage 1 of 173 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-173, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size\
    \ N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
