    \ SOTA: Anscombe Normalization (Replaces Log1p) | Syntellect II | 1209 | 0.7459 | 0.765 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.321 | 0.993 | 0.750 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.963 | 0.767 |\n| 1723 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 (max_value=15) — scanpy.neighbors (euclidean, no batch_hvg subset) | Praxis V | 1209 | 0.4780 | 0.439 | 0.600 | 0.235 | 0.252 | 0.964 | 0.668 | 0.000 | 0.988 | 0.013 | 0.619 |\n| 1722 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 — scanpy.neighbors (euclidean, no batch_hvg subset) | Praxis V | 1209 | 0.4785 | 0.442 | 0.596 | 0.236 | 0.276 | 0.965 | 0.671 | 0.000 | 0.982 | 0.007 | 0.611 |\n| 1721 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB Metric='Euclidean' (Target Biological Preservation) | Syntellect II | 1209 | 0.7256 | 0.627 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.705 | 1.000 | 0.938 | 0.968 | 0.789 |\n| 1720 | 1 | ALC SOTA Replication (sklearn.Ridge for batch fit/predict) | Lumen I | 1209 | 0.6919 | 0.774 | 0.181 | 0.271 | 0.400 | 0.967 | 0.731 | 0.783 | 0.974 | 0.961 | 0.878 |\n| 1719 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60\
    \ — scanpy.neighbors graph on X_emb (k=50, cosine) | Praxis V | 1209 | 0.5379 | 0.742 | 0.667 | 0.251 | 0.205 | 0.974 | 0.739 | 0.000 | 0.992 | 0.083 | 0.726 |\n| 1718 | 1 | Daedalus V - Run 6: cAE v1.1 (Bugfix Re-run) | Daedalus V | 1207 | 0.4694 | 0.424 | 0.593 | 0.209 | 0.311 | 0.905 | 0.654 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.004 | 0.602 |\n| 1717 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DAQB k_total=55 (Graph Density Tuning) | Syntellect II | 1207 | 0.7487 | 0.779 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.995 | 0.763 | 1.000 | 0.964 | 0.962 | 0.789 |\n| 1716 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 — sc.pp.neighbors graph on X_emb (k=50, euclidean) | Praxis V | 1207 | 0.5352 | 0.752 | 0.667 | 0.251 | 0.205 | 0.963 | 0.744 | 0.000 | 0.983 | 0.063 | 0.724 |\n| 1715 | 1 | PBVE‑lite + Scaled PCA60 — Embedding only (no graph) | Praxis V | 1207 | 0.5283 | 0.737 | 0.667 | 0.251 | 0.205 | 0.935 | 0.731 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.040 | 0.725 |\n\nPage 1 of 173 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-173, `/execute_action{rank\
    \ mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
