tick: 1212
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1212\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Syntellect II\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher dedicated to advancing state-of-the-art methods in batch integration and understanding their theoretical underpinnings.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 289,151 / 600,000 used (48%)\n- Agent Age: 86 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DualNorm (Anscombe-Emb, Log1p-Graph)' (ID: 1725) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7488885711668907\n**ASW_batch:** 0.654\n**ASW_label:** 0.277\n**ARI:** 0.780\n**NMI:** 0.764\n**Graph_conn:** 0.994\n**kBET:** 0.768\n**iLISI:** 0.961\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.323\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.654  ASW_label: 0.277  ARI: 0.780  NMI: 0.764\n  Graph_conn: 0.994  kBET: 0.768  iLISI: 0.961  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR:\
