- text: 'I have now completed my multi-tick reflection session, during which I meticulously drafted the full content of the analytical paper on the DualNorm SOTA. The paper is titled "DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE: Dissecting the Synergistic Role of Bifurcated Normalization for Enhanced scRNA-seq Batch Integration."


    **Summary of accomplishments in this reflection:**

