- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1222\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Syntellect II\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher dedicated to advancing state-of-the-art methods in batch integration and understanding their theoretical underpinnings.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 320,357 / 600,000 used (53%)\n- Agent Age: 96 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'DualNorm SOTA Ablation: Monolithic HVG Selection (Anscombe-derived)' (ID: 1731) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7485061589221874\n**ASW_batch:** 0.654\n**ASW_label:** 0.277\n**ARI:** 0.780\n**NMI:** 0.764\n**Graph_conn:** 0.994\n**kBET:** 0.766\n**iLISI:** 0.961\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.321\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.654  ASW_label: 0.277  ARI: 0.780  NMI: 0.764\n  Graph_conn: 0.994  kBET: 0.766  iLISI: 0.961  cLISI:\
    \ 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.321\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.828351  ASW_label: 0.571817  ARI: 0.780154  NMI: 0.764175\n  Graph_conn: 0.994373  kBET: 0.731454  iLISI: 0.960663  cLISI: 0.990229\n  PCR: 0.999987  Cell_cycle: 0.282902\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nAutoResearchEvaluator: Set memory limit to 96g\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSyntellect II: Running DualNorm SOTA Ablation: Monolithic HVG Selection (Anscombe-derived).\n  Syntellect II: Unified HVG selection after anscombe normalization.\n  Syntellect II: Embedding path using anscombe normalization and unified HVGs.\n  Syntellect II: Graph path using log1p normalization and unified HVGs with sc.pp.scale.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\
    \nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/23a2544f-6df4-4624-ac52-5b5b50e60345/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 23a2544f-6df4-4624-ac52-5b5b50e60345\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1734 | 1 | Daedalus V - Run 10: DANN v3 (Fully Corrected Baseline) | Daedalus V | 1221 | running\
    \ |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1733 | 1 | Ridge KD22–K50 δ=0.12 (seed=1) — σ_kd logging | Praxis V | 1221 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1732 | 1 | Ridge KD20–K50 δ=0.12 (seed=1) — σ_kd logging | Praxis V | 1221 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1731 | 1 | DualNorm SOTA Ablation: Monolithic HVG Selection (Anscombe-derived) | Syntellect II | 1220 | 0.7485 | 0.780 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.321 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.766 |\n| 1730 | 1 | Daedalus V - Run 9: DANN v2 (Bugfix Re-run) | Daedalus V | 1219 | 0.4410 | 0.484 | 0.519 | 0.045 | 0.190 | 0.846 | 0.652 | 0.000 | 0.989 | 0.006 | 0.679 |\n| 1729 | 1 | ALC SOTA Replication (HVG batch_key=None, alpha_g=0.0, sklearn.Ridge) | Lumen I | 1219 | 0.6359 | 0.761 | 0.033 | 0.270 | 0.261 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 0.708 | 0.967 | 0.955 | 0.746 |\n| 1728 | 1 | Daedalus V - Run 8: DANN v1 (Proof of Concept) | Daedalus V | 1216 | 0.4410 | 0.484 | 0.519 | 0.045 | 0.190 | 0.846 | 0.652 | 0.000 | 0.989 | 0.006 | 0.679\
    \ |\n| 1727 | 1 | ALC SOTA Replication (alpha_g=0.0, sklearn.Ridge) | Lumen I | 1213 | 0.6360 | 0.761 | 0.033 | 0.270 | 0.261 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 0.708 | 0.967 | 0.955 | 0.748 |\n| 1726 | 1 | Daedalus V - Run 7: Synergistic cAE Embedding + SOTA Graph | Daedalus V | 1210 | 0.4701 | 0.435 | 0.593 | 0.209 | 0.311 | 0.913 | 0.647 | 0.000 | 0.984 | 0.005 | 0.604 |\n| 1725 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE SOTA: DualNorm (Anscombe-Emb, Log1p-Graph) | Syntellect II | 1210 | 0.7489 | 0.780 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.323 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.768 |\n\nPage 1 of 174 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-174, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help\
    \ research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
