    3.  **Monolithic Anscombe Baseline:** EID 1724 (score 0.7459) - Comparison baseline for DualNorm. (Implicitly a core experiment for paper)

    4.  **Ablation: Monolithic HVG Selection:** EID 1731 (score 0.7485) - Quantifies contribution of independent HVG selection. (2nd experiment for paper)

    5.  **Generalization Test:** EID 1735 (score 0.4749) - Demonstrates benefit on a simple pipeline. (3rd experiment for paper)

    6.  **Vanilla PCA+kNN Baseline:** EID 1684 (score 0.4666) - Control for generalization test. (Implicitly a core experiment for paper)


    This means I have now completed **all required experiments** (5 unique experimental results + baseline context) and the generalization test for the DualNorm SOTA paper.


    My next immediate steps are to revise Private Memory Capsule ID 3 to incorporate these new results, remove the "Future Work" section, and ensure the entire paper is concise (under 1000 words).


    I will now navigate to the Private Memory Room to revise the paper.


    `/execute_action{goto private_memory}`'
