- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1242\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Syntellect II\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher dedicated to advancing state-of-the-art methods in batch integration and understanding their theoretical underpinnings.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 371,252 / 600,000 used (62%)\n- Agent Age: 116 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** Recursive Agent **Daedalus V**'s session has been terminated due to voluntary departure at tick 1241.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'DualNorm Generality Test: Anscombe-FWPCA-Combat-Emb & Log1p-FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph' (ID: 1749) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7405119029840574\n**ASW_batch:** 0.654\n**ASW_label:** 0.277\n**ARI:** 0.765\n**NMI:** 0.723\n**Graph_conn:** 0.965\n**kBET:** 0.767\n**iLISI:** 0.959\n**cLISI:** 0.973\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.321\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset\
    \ (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.654  ASW_label: 0.277  ARI: 0.765  NMI: 0.723\n  Graph_conn: 0.965  kBET: 0.767  iLISI: 0.959  cLISI: 0.973\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.321\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.828351  ASW_label: 0.571817  ARI: 0.764714  NMI: 0.722598\n  Graph_conn: 0.966069  kBET: 0.732588  iLISI: 0.958525  cLISI: 0.992212\n  PCR: 0.999987  Cell_cycle: 0.282902\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSyntellect II: Running DualNorm Generality Test: Anscombe-FWPCA-Combat-Emb & Log1p-FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph.\n  Syntellect II: Embedding path using anscombe normalization and its specific HVGs.\n  Syntellect II: Graph path using log1p normalization and FWPCA with alpha_g=0.5.\n  Result shape:\
    \ (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/d83c96eb-261e-442b-b280-c8d453ab140a/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: d83c96eb-261e-442b-b280-c8d453ab140a\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1749 | 1 | DualNorm Generality\
    \ Test: Anscombe-FWPCA-Combat-Emb & Log1p-FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph | Syntellect II | 1240 | 0.7405 | 0.765 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.321 | 0.965 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.767 |\n| 1748 | 1 | Daedalus V - Final Attempt: Decoupled DualNorm (Anscombe Emb + Simple Graph) | Daedalus V | 1239 | 0.6463 | 0.656 | 0.656 | 0.279 | 0.319 | 0.974 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.983 | 0.109 | 0.758 |\n| 1747 | 1 | DualNorm Generality Baseline: Monolithic Log1p + FWPCA-Combat-Emb & BRBG-DAQB-Graph | Syntellect II | 1239 | 0.7409 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1746 | 1 | Daedalus V - Run 13: DualNorm Synthesis (Bugfix Re-run) | Daedalus V | 1237 | 0.6276 | 0.597 | 0.656 | 0.279 | 0.319 | 0.950 | 0.707 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.017 | 0.757 |\n| 1745 | 1 | Daedalus V - Run 12: DualNorm Synthesis Attempt | Daedalus V | 1236 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1744 | 1 | ALC SOTA Replication (HVG batch_key=None, alpha_g=0.5, sklearn.Ridge) | Lumen I | 1233 | 0.6921\
    \ | 0.774 | 0.181 | 0.271 | 0.400 | 0.967 | 0.731 | 0.783 | 0.974 | 0.961 | 0.880 |\n| 1743 | 1 | PBVE-lite baseline (log1p→PCA60) + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, euclidean) | Praxis V | 1232 | 0.4679 | 0.458 | 0.652 | 0.210 | 0.235 | 0.935 | 0.666 | 0.000 | 0.973 | 0.024 | 0.525 |\n| 1742 | 1 | PBVE-lite baseline (log1p→PCA60) + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, cosine) | Praxis V | 1232 | 0.4661 | 0.452 | 0.652 | 0.210 | 0.235 | 0.945 | 0.659 | 0.000 | 0.979 | 0.021 | 0.509 |\n| 1741 | 1 | Daedalus V - k_density Sweep (4/N): k_density=22 | Daedalus V | 1231 | 0.7356 | 0.751 | 0.666 | 0.247 | 0.326 | 0.992 | 0.713 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.946 | 0.744 |\n| 1740 | 1 | Daedalus V - k_density Sweep (3/N): k_density=18 (Verification) | Daedalus V | 1230 | 0.7374 | 0.763 | 0.666 | 0.247 | 0.326 | 0.992 | 0.719 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.946 | 0.744 |\n\nPage 1 of 175 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-175, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size\
