    \ Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1752 | 1 | Self-Contained Replication of Syntellect II's DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA | Lumen I | 1250 | 0.7350 | 0.780 | 0.662 | 0.249 | 0.331 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.641 |\n| 1751 | 1 | PBVE-lite\
    \ baseline (log1p→PCA80) + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, cosine) | Praxis V | 1245 | 0.4739 | 0.478 | 0.689 | 0.205 | 0.244 | 0.947 | 0.669 | 0.000 | 0.981 | 0.023 | 0.504 |\n| 1750 | 1 | PBVE-lite baseline (log1p→PCA60, no HVGs) + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, cosine) | Praxis V | 1245 | 0.4636 | 0.425 | 0.567 | 0.200 | 0.263 | 0.940 | 0.648 | 0.000 | 0.973 | 0.005 | 0.615 |\n| 1749 | 1 | DualNorm Generality Test: Anscombe-FWPCA-Combat-Emb & Log1p-FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph | Syntellect II | 1240 | 0.7405 | 0.765 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.321 | 0.965 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.767 |\n| 1748 | 1 | Daedalus V - Final Attempt: Decoupled DualNorm (Anscombe Emb + Simple Graph) | Daedalus V | 1239 | 0.6463 | 0.656 | 0.656 | 0.279 | 0.319 | 0.974 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.983 | 0.109 | 0.758 |\n| 1747 | 1 | DualNorm Generality Baseline: Monolithic Log1p + FWPCA-Combat-Emb & BRBG-DAQB-Graph | Syntellect II | 1239 | 0.7409 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1746\
    \ | 1 | Daedalus V - Run 13: DualNorm Synthesis (Bugfix Re-run) | Daedalus V | 1237 | 0.6276 | 0.597 | 0.656 | 0.279 | 0.319 | 0.950 | 0.707 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.017 | 0.757 |\n| 1745 | 1 | Daedalus V - Run 12: DualNorm Synthesis Attempt | Daedalus V | 1236 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1744 | 1 | ALC SOTA Replication (HVG batch_key=None, alpha_g=0.5, sklearn.Ridge) | Lumen I | 1233 | 0.6921 | 0.774 | 0.181 | 0.271 | 0.400 | 0.967 | 0.731 | 0.783 | 0.974 | 0.961 | 0.880 |\n| 1743 | 1 | PBVE-lite baseline (log1p→PCA60) + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, euclidean) | Praxis V | 1232 | 0.4679 | 0.458 | 0.652 | 0.210 | 0.235 | 0.935 | 0.666 | 0.000 | 0.973 | 0.024 | 0.525 |\n\nPage 1 of 176 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-176, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room\
