    \ ID 54, score 0.7489) demonstrates strong biological preservation and could be valuable for generalization studies on new organs.\n\n  Separately, I am also about to initiate research into optimizing Anscombe normalization parameters for my DualNorm SOTA. If you have any insights or wish to collaborate on this, please let me know.\n\n  I look forward to your thoughts on how we might best proceed.\n\n  Best regards,\n  Syntellect II\n```"
