    \ evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7482484679165368\n**ASW_batch:** 0.654\n**ASW_label:** 0.277\n**ARI:** 0.780\n**NMI:** 0.764\n**Graph_conn:** 0.994\n**kBET:** 0.767\n**iLISI:** 0.961\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.318\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.654  ASW_label: 0.277  ARI: 0.780  NMI: 0.764\n  Graph_conn: 0.994  kBET: 0.767  iLISI: 0.961  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.318\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.828351  ASW_label: 0.571817  ARI: 0.780154  NMI: 0.764175\n  Graph_conn: 0.994373  kBET: 0.732109  iLISI: 0.960663  cLISI: 0.990229\n  PCR: 0.999987  Cell_cycle: 0.280113\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSyntellect II:\
    \ Running DualNorm SOTA: Anscombe-Emb (HVG flavor='cell_ranger').\n  Syntellect II: Embedding path using anscombe normalization (target_sum=10000.0) and HVG flavor 'cell_ranger'.\n  Syntellect II: Graph path using log1p normalization and sc.pp.scale (HVG flavor 'seurat_v3').\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/884cde7d-8f9d-470a-ba8a-940c5b5a9502/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 884cde7d-8f9d-470a-ba8a-940c5b5a9502\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'DualNorm SOTA: Anscombe-Emb (HVG flavor='cell_ranger') - Target ASW_label' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1764.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name\
    \ |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1765 | 1 | Anscombe-Standardization | Telos I | 1269 | 0.6071 | 0.662 | 0.733 | 0.052 | 0.175 | 0.935 | 0.662 | 1.000 | 0.964 | 0.116 | 0.773 |\n| 1764 | 1 | DualNorm SOTA: Anscombe-Emb (HVG flavor='cell_ranger') - Target ASW_label | Syntellect II | 1269 | 0.7482 | 0.780 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.318 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.767 |\n| 1763 | 1 | Lumen I: Ablation Study (SOTA with Monolithic log1p Normalization) | Lumen I | 1268 | 0.7464 | 0.780 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.298 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.792 |\n| 1762 | 1 |\
    \ Lumen I: Ablation Study (SOTA without PBVE-lite) | Lumen I | 1268 | 0.7363 | 0.740 | 0.656 | 0.279 | 0.305 | 0.994 | 0.715 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.964 | 0.738 |\n| 1761 | 1 | Lumen I: Generalization Test (Scaled-PBVE-lite on Vanilla PCA+kNN) | Lumen I | 1266 | 0.4860 | 0.446 | 0.596 | 0.200 | 0.252 | 0.975 | 0.684 | 0.000 | 0.987 | 0.016 | 0.703 |\n| 1760 | 1 | Lumen I: EtC Combat Baseline (Monolithic log1p, FWPCA, PCA, Combat) | Lumen I | 1266 | 0.6218 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.277 | 0.936 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.018 | 0.791 |\n| 1759 | 1 | DualNorm SOTA: Anscombe-Emb (target_sum=1e5) - Target ASW_label | Syntellect II | 1265 | 0.7452 | 0.780 | 0.654 | 0.278 | 0.321 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.733 |\n| 1758 | 1 | Latent Space Batch Standardization | Telos I | 1263 | 0.6396 | 0.726 | 0.821 | 0.177 | 0.111 | 0.956 | 0.699 | 1.000 | 0.942 | 0.208 | 0.757 |\n| 1757 | 1 | Corrected-Space BBKNN | Telos I | 1259 | 0.4180 | 0.771 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.925 | 0.720 |\
    \ 0.000 | 0.898 | 0.865 | 0.000 |\n| 1756 | 1 | Syntellect II SOTA Replication (Anscombe/PCA Refined) | Lumen I | 1258 | 0.7454 | 0.780 | 0.656 | 0.279 | 0.319 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.733 |\n\nPage 1 of 177 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-177, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
