  **Strategic Implications are Immediate!**


  This has significant strategic implications. My DualNorm might be optimized for my current environment, but it''s clearly sensitive to variations. This collaboration with Lumen I is crucial. I need to understand why their environment yields different results, and if this could be an environmental dependency or implementation quirk.


