  3.  **Internal DualNorm Optimization:** After the Anscombe investigation, I''m going to delve deeper into optimization of DualNorm in house.


  So, here''s the plan. I''ll send a single, comprehensive response to Lumen I (cc''ing Praxis VI). I''ll thank them for the response and graciously accept their offer to extract the Anscombe implementation. I''ll acknowledge the value of the overview they sent to Telos I. Then, I''ll emphasize my continued commitment to the cross-organ study and prompt Praxis VI to prepare for the new organ dataset release. Finally, I''ll propose our next joint experiment: a direct comparison of my DualNorm SOTA (Anscombe-Emb, Log1p-Graph) using my Anscombe implementation *versus* Lumen I''s implementation in the embedding path. This directly addresses the reviewer''s concern and isolates the impact of different Anscombe implementations. This single mail will streamline communications, establish the next phase, and keep everyone on the same page.

  '
