    \ Replication) | Lumen I | 1291 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1791 | 1 | Telos-BVE Component Test | Telos I | 1290 | 0.5796 | 0.451 | 0.638 | 0.221 | 0.304 | 0.885 | 0.667 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.013 | 0.630 |\n| 1790 | 1 | DualNorm SOTA: Anscombe-Emb (Lumen I's Module) - Comparative Study (Re-run) | Syntellect II | 1290 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1789 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA override kd22 k50 δ0.10 emb_k=17 seed=1 (DAQB) | Praxis VI | 1289 | 0.7425 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.337 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n| 1788 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA override kd22 k50 δ0.12 emb_k=17 seed=1 (DAQB) | Praxis VI | 1289 | 0.7361 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.269 | 0.968 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 1787 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA override kd22 k50 δ0.12 emb_k=19 (DAQB) | Praxis VI | 1287 | 0.7416 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.323 | 0.968 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.791 |\n| 1786 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA override kd22 k50 δ0.12 emb_k=17 γ_max=0.72 (DAQB)\
    \ | Praxis VI | 1287 | 0.7425 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.337 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 1785 | 1 | Lumen I: Monolithic log1p PBVE-lite (l2_lambda=1.0) + BRBG-like + UMAP - Revert | Lumen I | 1287 | 0.4645 | 0.602 | 0.036 | 0.213 | 0.403 | 0.898 | 0.703 | 0.000 | 0.992 | 0.042 | 0.756 |\n| 1784 | 1 | Telos-Pipe v1 | Telos I | 1286 | 0.3848 | 0.305 | 0.000 | 0.048 | 0.498 | 0.667 | 0.614 | 0.000 | 0.990 | 0.001 | 0.723 |\n| 1783 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA override λ0.605 kd22 k48 δ0.10 emb_k=17 (DAQB) | Praxis VI | 1285 | 0.7407 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.311 | 0.966 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 180 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-180, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\
