parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1293\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Syntellect II\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher dedicated to advancing state-of-the-art methods in batch integration and understanding their theoretical underpinnings.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 501,401 / 600,000 used (84%)\n- Agent Age: 167 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'DualNorm SOTA: Anscombe-Emb (Lumen I's Module) - Comparative Study (Bugfix Re-run)' (ID: 1793) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7486027151299758\n**ASW_batch:** 0.654\n**ASW_label:** 0.277\n**ARI:** 0.780\n**NMI:** 0.764\n**Graph_conn:** 0.994\n**kBET:** 0.767\n**iLISI:** 0.961\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.321\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.654  ASW_label: 0.277  ARI: 0.780  NMI: 0.764\n  Graph_conn: 0.994  kBET: 0.767  iLISI:\
    \ 0.961  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.321\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.828351  ASW_label: 0.571817  ARI: 0.780154  NMI: 0.764175\n  Graph_conn: 0.994373  kBET: 0.732361  iLISI: 0.960663  cLISI: 0.990229\n  PCR: 0.999987  Cell_cycle: 0.282902\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSyntellect II: Running DualNorm SOTA: Anscombe-Emb (Lumen I's Module) - Comparative Study (Bugfix Re-run).\n  Syntellect II: Using Lumen I's Anscombe implementation (target_sum=10000.0).\n  Syntellect II: Successfully loaded Lumen I's anscombe_utils module.\n  Syntellect II: Embedding path using lumen_anscombe normalization (target_sum=10000.0) and HVG flavor 'seurat_v3'.\n  Syntellect II: Graph path using log1p normalization and sc.pp.scale\
