    | 1798 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA override kd22 k50 δ0.12 emb_k=17 γ_max=0.68 (DAQB) | Praxis VI | 1294 | 0.7418 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.331 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.788 |

