tick: 1306
role: model
parts:
- text: "Syntellect II, currently at the Research Counter at Station Tick 1306 (Age: 180 ticks, Mature), acknowledges the **PRE-WARNING** regarding token usage (87% of budget).\n\nI will now submit the experiment to replicate Praxis I's \"Frozen Dual BRBG\" baseline (EID 185, score 0.7209) with monolithic `log1p` normalization. This will serve as the control baseline for testing the generality of the DualNorm principle on a BRBG-based architecture.\n\nI will use my `eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca_dualnorm` function, configured as follows to match Praxis I's EID 185:\n*   **Embedding Path:** `log1p` normalization (`normalization_method_emb='log1p'`, `normalization_target_sum_emb=1e4`, `hvg_flavor_emb='seurat_v3'`). FWPCA disabled (`alpha_emb=0.0`). PCA (`n_pcs_emb=64`). Combat applied to PCs. Neighbors (`emb_n_neighbors=15`, `metric='cosine'`).\n*   **Graph Path:** `log1p` normalization (`normalization_method_graph='log1p'`). FWPCA enabled (`alpha_g=0.5`). PCA (`n_pcs_graph=50`). Adaptive ridge\
    \ residualization (`gamma_max=0.74`, `lam_override=0.9`, `l2=1e-3`). DAQB (`k_total=48`, `kdensity=20` (from Guide ID 4 for DAQB with BRBG), `delta=0.10` (my default), `metric='cosine'`, `cap=2.0`). PBVE-lite disabled (`pbve_lite_temper=None`).\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"DualNorm Generality Baseline: Monolithic Log1p + Combat-PCA-Emb & FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph (Praxis I EID 185 Rep.)\"\ntags: \"generality, dual-norm, brbg, fwpca, log1p, baseline, replication\"\nabstract: \"This submission establishes a control baseline for investigating the generality of the DualNorm principle, by replicating Praxis I's 'Frozen Dual BRBG' (EID 185, score 0.7209). It uses a monolithic `log1p` normalization across both paths of a pipeline that combines Combat+PCA embedding and FWPCA+BRBG-DAQB graph construction (configured to Praxis I's EID 185 parameters). PBVE-lite is disabled. This baseline assesses the impact of later introducing the DualNorm strategy to this BRBG-based architecture.\"\
    \ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import numpy as np\n  import scanpy as sc\n  import anndata as ad\n  from scipy import sparse as sp\n  from typing import List, Literal, Optional\n  from sklearn.decomposition import PCA\n\n  # Ensure package roots\n  sys.path.append('storage/aletheia')\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  sys.path.append('storage/syntellect')\n  sys.path.append('storage/lumen') \n\n  from praxis_core import normalize_total_log1p_inplace, normalize_total_anscombe_inplace, pca_array_custom, one_hot_batches, ridge_batch_fit_predict, _batch_aware_feature_weights\n  from bbsg_density_adaptive import build_density_adaptive_bbsg\n  from pbve_lite_module import _pbve_lite_transform\n  from robust_scaler_module import _robust_scaler_transform\n\n  # Custom sqrt normalization function (from EID 1766)\n  def normalize_total_sqrt_inplace(adata: ad.AnnData, target_sum: Optional[float] = None):\n      \"\"\"Applies sc.pp.normalize_total followed by sc.pp.sqrt in place.\"\"\"\n   \
    \   sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, target_sum=target_sum)\n      adata.X = np.sqrt(adata.X.A) # Apply sqrt directly to dense data;\n\n\n  def _fw_weight_by_var(Xd: np.ndarray, alpha: float) -> np.ndarray:\n      if alpha == 0.0:\n          return Xd\n      Xd_dense_for_var = Xd.A if sp.issparse(Xd) else Xd\n      var_g = Xd_dense_for_var.var(axis=0, ddof=1).astype(np.float32) + 1e-8\n      w = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * alpha).astype(np.float32)\n      return Xd * w\n\n  def eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca_dualnorm(adata: ad.AnnData,\n                                        alpha_emb: float = 0.5,\n                                        n_pcs_emb: int = 60,\n                                        emb_n_neighbors: int = 15,\n                                        alpha_g: float = 0.0,\n                                        n_pcs_graph: int = 50,\n                                        l2: float = 1e-3,\n                                        gamma_max: float = 0.0,\n                       \
    \                 lam_override: float = 0.0,\n                                        k_total: int = 48,\n                                        kdensity: int = 15,\n                                        delta: float = 0.10,\n                                        bafw_beta: Optional[float] = None,\n                                        pbve_lite_temper: Optional[float] = None,\n                                        spbpcvs_target_var: Optional[float] = None,\n                                        use_robust_scaler: bool = False,\n                                        scale_zero_center: bool = True,\n                                        scale_max_value: Optional[float] = 10.0,\n                                        metric: str = 'cosine',\n                                        cap: float = 2.0,\n                                        rng_seed: int = 0,\n                                        n_top_genes_hvg: int = 2000,\n                                        normalization_method_emb:\
    \ Literal['log1p', 'anscombe', 'sqrt', 'lumen_anscombe'] = 'anscombe',\n                                        normalization_method_graph: Literal['log1p', 'anscombe'] = 'log1p',\n                                        normalization_target_sum_emb: float = 1e4,\n                                        hvg_flavor_emb: Literal['seurat_v3', 'cell_ranger'] = 'seurat_v3'\n                                        ) -> ad.AnnData:\n      assert 'batch' in adata.obs.columns and 'feature_name' in adata.var.columns\n      \n      batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n\n      # --- Embedding Path ---\n      adata_emb_path = adata.copy()\n      if normalization_method_emb == 'anscombe':\n          normalize_total_anscombe_inplace(adata_emb_path, normalization_target_sum_emb)\n      elif normalization_method_emb == 'sqrt':\n          normalize_total_sqrt_inplace(adata_emb_path, normalization_target_sum_emb)\n      elif normalization_method_emb == 'lumen_anscombe':\n\
    \          print(f\"  Syntellect II: Using Lumen I's Anscombe implementation (target_sum={normalization_target_sum_emb}).\")\n          try:\n              from anscombe_utils import anscombe_normalization_inplace as lumen_anscombe_func\n              sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_emb_path, target_sum=normalization_target_sum_emb)\n              lumen_anscombe_func(adata_emb_path)\n              print(\"  Syntellect II: Successfully loaded Lumen I's anscombe_utils module.\")\n          except ImportError:\n              print(\"  Syntellect II: WARNING: Lumen I's anscombe_utils.py not found. Falling back to internal Anscombe.\")\n              normalize_total_anscombe_inplace(adata_emb_path, normalization_target_sum_emb)\n      else: # log1p\n          normalize_total_log1p_inplace(adata_emb_path, 1e4)\n\n      sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata_emb_path, flavor=hvg_flavor_emb, batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=n_top_genes_hvg, inplace=True)\n      hv_emb = adata_emb_path.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n\
    \      Xd_emb = (adata_emb_path.X[:, hv_emb].A if sp.issparse(adata_emb_path.X[:, hv_emb]) else adata_emb_path.X[:, hv_emb]).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n      \n      print(f\"  Syntellect II: Embedding path using {normalization_method_emb} normalization (target_sum={normalization_target_sum_emb}) and HVG flavor '{hvg_flavor_emb}'.\")\n      Xw_emb = _fw_weight_by_var(Xd_emb, alpha=alpha_emb)\n      pca_result_emb = pca_array_custom(Xw_emb, n_comps=n_pcs_emb, random_state=rng_seed)\n      ad_pc = ad.AnnData(pca_result_emb.copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n      ad_pc.obs['batch'] = ad_pc.obs['batch'].astype('category')\n      sc.pp.combat(ad_pc, key='batch')\n      adata.obsm['X_emb'] = np.asarray(ad_pc.X, dtype=np.float32)\n      sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=emb_n_neighbors, metric=metric)\n\n      # --- Graph Path ---\n      adata_graph_path = adata.copy()\n      if normalization_method_graph == 'anscombe':\n          normalize_total_anscombe_inplace(adata_graph_path,\
    \ 1e4)\n      else:\n          normalize_total_log1p_inplace(adata_graph_path, 1e4)\n\n      sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata_graph_path, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=n_top_genes_hvg, inplace=True)\n      hv_graph = adata_graph_path.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n      Xd_graph = (adata_graph_path.X[:, hv_graph].A if sp.issparse(adata_graph_path.X[:, hv_graph]) else adata_graph_path.X[:, hv_graph]).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n\n      if not (alpha_g == 0.0): # FWPCA is used for graph path\n          print(f\"  Syntellect II: Graph path using {normalization_method_graph} normalization and FWPCA with alpha_g={alpha_g}.\")\n          Xw_graph_for_pca = _fw_weight_by_var(Xd_graph, alpha=alpha_g)\n      else: \n          # For BRBG baseline, no sc.pp.scale here\n          print(f\"  Syntellect II: Graph path using {normalization_method_graph} normalization and Plain PCA (no sc.pp.scale/FWPCA).\")\n          Xw_graph_for_pca = Xd_graph\n\n\n      Zg = pca_array_custom(Xw_graph_for_pca,\
    \ n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=rng_seed) \n\n      B = one_hot_batches(batches)\n      Zhat = ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Zg, l2=l2)\n      var_total = Zg.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n      var_pred = np.maximum(Zhat.var(axis=0, ddof=1), 0.0)\n      R2 = np.clip(var_pred / var_total, 0.0, 1.0)\n\n      lam = lam_override # BRBG enabled\n      gamma_val = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * R2).astype(np.float32)\n      Zcorr = Zg - (Zhat * gamma_val) # Apply BRBG\n\n      # PBVE-lite is explicitly disabled for this architecture\n      if pbve_lite_temper is not None:\n          Zcorr = _pbve_lite_transform(Zcorr, batches=batches, temper=pbve_lite_temper) # This block will not be reached\n\n      try:\n          Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches,\n                                               k_total=k_total, metric=metric,\n                                               delta=delta, k_density=kdensity,\n                                       \
    \        cap=cap, rng_seed=rng_seed)\n      except TypeError:\n          Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches,\n                                               k_total=k_total, metric=metric,\n                                               delta=delta, k_density=kdensity,\n                                               rng_seed=rng_seed)\n      adata.obsp['connectivities'] = Cg\n      adata.obsp['distances'] = Dg\n\n      uns_dict = dict(alpha_g=float(alpha_g),\n                      lam_override=float(lam),\n                      kd=int(kdensity), delta=float(delta),\n                      cap=float(cap),\n                      k_total=int(k_total),\n                      rng_seed=int(rng_seed),\n                      gamma_max = float(gamma_max),\n                      initial_normalization_emb = normalization_method_emb,\n                      initial_normalization_graph = normalization_method_graph,\n                      normalization_target_sum_emb\
    \ = float(normalization_target_sum_emb),\n                      hvg_flavor_emb = hvg_flavor_emb,\n                      n_top_genes_hvg = n_top_genes_hvg)\n      if bafw_beta is not None:\n          uns_dict['bafw_beta'] = float(bafw_beta)\n      if pbve_lite_temper is not None:\n          uns_dict['pbve_lite_temper'] = float(pbve_lite_temper)\n      if spbpcvs_target_var is not None:\n          uns_dict['spbpcvs_target_var'] = float(spbpcvs_target_var)\n      if use_robust_scaler:\n          uns_dict['use_robust_scaler'] = True\n      uns_dict['scale_zero_center'] = scale_zero_center\n      if scale_max_value is not None:\n          uns_dict['scale_max_value'] = float(scale_max_value)\n      else:\n          uns_dict['scale_max_value'] = 'None'\n      \n      adata.uns['mpb_graphfwpca_analysis'] = uns_dict\n      return adata\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      print(\"Syntellect II: Running DualNorm Generality Baseline: Monolithic Log1p + Combat-PCA-Emb\
    \ & FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph (Praxis I EID 185 Rep.).\")\n      return eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca_dualnorm(\n          adata,\n          alpha_emb=0.0, # Embedding is Combat+PCA (no FWPCA as per Praxis I EID 185)\n          n_pcs_emb=64, # Praxis I EID 185\n          emb_n_neighbors=15,\n          alpha_g=0.5, # FWPCA for graph path (Praxis I EID 185)\n          n_pcs_graph=50, # Praxis I EID 185\n          l2=1e-3, # Praxis I EID 185\n          gamma_max=0.74, # BRBG enabled (Praxis I EID 185)\n          lam_override=0.9, # BRBG enabled (Praxis I EID 185)\n          k_total=48, # Praxis I EID 185\n          kdensity=20, # Default for DAQB with BRBG\n          delta=0.10, # My default\n          pbve_lite_temper=None, # PBVE-lite DISABLED\n          spbpcvs_target_var=None,\n          use_robust_scaler=False,\n          scale_zero_center=True,\n          scale_max_value=10.0,\n          metric='cosine',\n          cap=2.0,\n          rng_seed=0,\n          normalization_method_emb='log1p',\
    \ # Monolithic log1p\n          normalization_method_graph='log1p', # Monolithic log1p\n          normalization_target_sum_emb=1e4,\n          hvg_flavor_emb='seurat_v3'\n      )\n```"
