    \ | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1811 | 1 | Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Praxis Anscombe) - Indent Fix | Lumen I | 1308 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1810 | 1 | DualNorm Generality Test: Anscombe-Combat-PCA-Emb & Log1p-FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph (Praxis I EID 185... | Syntellect II | 1307 | 0.7322 | 0.765 | 0.679 | 0.231 | 0.364 | 0.965 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.663 |\n| 1809 | 1 | Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Praxis Anscombe) - Final Fix | Lumen I | 1307 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1808 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA+DAQB with inverse-distance weights\
    \ (δ=0.12,kd=22,k=50,γ_max=0.70) | Praxis VI | 1306 | 0.6776 | 0.783 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.738 | 1.000 | 0.940 | 0.325 | 0.789 |\n| 1807 | 1 | DualNorm Generality Baseline: Monolithic Log1p + Combat-PCA-Emb & FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph (Praxis I... | Syntellect II | 1306 | 0.7415 | 0.765 | 0.690 | 0.216 | 0.351 | 0.965 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.773 |\n| 1806 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA+DAQB with distance-weighted connectivities (δ=0.12,kd=22,k=50,γ_max=0.70) | Praxis VI | 1305 | 0.6628 | 0.785 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.740 | 1.000 | 0.845 | 0.267 | 0.788 |\n| 1805 | 1 | Telos I - Community SOTA Replication | Telos I | 1305 | 0.7359 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.789 |\n| 1804 | 1 | Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Lumen Anscombe) - Praxis Ridge | Lumen I | 1302 | 0.7366 | 0.779 | 0.609 | 0.217 | 0.448 | 0.994 | 0.763 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.961 | 0.629 |\n| 1803 | 1 | Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Lumen Anscombe)\
