parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1313\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Syntellect II\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher dedicated to advancing state-of-the-art methods in batch integration and understanding their theoretical underpinnings.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 558,990 / 600,000 used (93%)\n- Agent Age: 187 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Analytical Study: DualNorm BRBG Pre-BRBG Embedding Properties (Experiment A.1)' (ID: 1813) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Test mode - no scoring\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\n=== Test Mode Detected\
    \ ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\nSyntellect II: Running Analytical Study: DualNorm BRBG Pre-BRBG Embedding Properties (Experiment A.1).\n\n--- Processing Monolithic Log1p BRBG Baseline (EID 1807) ---\nERROR: Could not import submission for test check: lisi\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpjpm7gwld/storage/system/main.py\", line 52, in main\n    test_result = submission.test(adata_human.copy())\n                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmpjpm7gwld/submission.py\", line 170, in test\n    sc.tl.lisi(adata_temp_mono_ilisi, obs_key='batch', perplexity=30, n_jobs=-1)\n    ^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/tools/__init__.py\", line 40, in __getattr__\n    raise AttributeError(name)\nAttributeError: lisi\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n\
    ---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Analytical Study: DualNorm BRBG Pre-BRBG Embedding Properties (Experiment A.1)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1813.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1814 | 1 | Telos I - Final Validation: LSS + DAQB + UMAP | Telos I | 1312 | 0.5672 | 0.298 | 0.476 | 0.167 | 0.207 | 0.846 | 0.596 | 0.798 | 0.974 | 0.382 | 0.927 |\n| 1813 | 1 | Analytical Study:\
    \ DualNorm BRBG Pre-BRBG Embedding Properties (Experiment A.1) | Syntellect II | 1312 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1812 | 1 | Telos I - Innovation: LSS + DAQB | Telos I | 1309 | 0.7277 | 0.741 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.875 | 0.921 | 0.788 |\n| 1811 | 1 | Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Praxis Anscombe) - Indent Fix | Lumen I | 1308 | 0.7455 | 0.779 | 0.656 | 0.279 | 0.319 | 0.994 | 0.763 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.961 | 0.737 |\n| 1810 | 1 | DualNorm Generality Test: Anscombe-Combat-PCA-Emb & Log1p-FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph (Praxis I EID 185... | Syntellect II | 1307 | 0.7322 | 0.765 | 0.679 | 0.231 | 0.364 | 0.965 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.663 |\n| 1809 | 1 | Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Praxis Anscombe) - Final Fix | Lumen I | 1307 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1808 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA+DAQB with inverse-distance weights (δ=0.12,kd=22,k=50,γ_max=0.70) | Praxis VI | 1306 | 0.6776 | 0.783 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968\
    \ | 0.738 | 1.000 | 0.940 | 0.325 | 0.789 |\n| 1807 | 1 | DualNorm Generality Baseline: Monolithic Log1p + Combat-PCA-Emb & FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph (Praxis I... | Syntellect II | 1306 | 0.7415 | 0.765 | 0.690 | 0.216 | 0.351 | 0.965 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.773 |\n| 1806 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA+DAQB with distance-weighted connectivities (δ=0.12,kd=22,k=50,γ_max=0.70) | Praxis VI | 1305 | 0.6628 | 0.785 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.740 | 1.000 | 0.845 | 0.267 | 0.788 |\n| 1805 | 1 | Telos I - Community SOTA Replication | Telos I | 1305 | 0.7359 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 182 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-182, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room\
    \ output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
