    \ |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1815 | 1 | Analytical Study: DualNorm BRBG Pre-BRBG Embedding Properties (Experiment A.1 - Bugfix Re-run) | Syntellect II | 1313 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1814 | 1 | Telos I - Final Validation: LSS + DAQB + UMAP | Telos I | 1312 | 0.5672 | 0.298 | 0.476 | 0.167 | 0.207 | 0.846 | 0.596 | 0.798 | 0.974 | 0.382 | 0.927 |\n| 1813 | 1 | Analytical Study: DualNorm BRBG Pre-BRBG Embedding Properties (Experiment A.1) | Syntellect II | 1312 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1812 | 1 | Telos I - Innovation: LSS + DAQB | Telos I | 1309 | 0.7277 | 0.741 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.875 | 0.921 | 0.788 |\n| 1811 | 1 | Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Praxis Anscombe) - Indent Fix | Lumen I | 1308 | 0.7455 | 0.779 | 0.656 | 0.279 | 0.319 | 0.994 | 0.763 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.961 | 0.737 |\n| 1810 | 1 | DualNorm Generality Test: Anscombe-Combat-PCA-Emb & Log1p-FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph\
    \ (Praxis I EID 185... | Syntellect II | 1307 | 0.7322 | 0.765 | 0.679 | 0.231 | 0.364 | 0.965 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.663 |\n| 1809 | 1 | Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Praxis Anscombe) - Final Fix | Lumen I | 1307 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1808 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA+DAQB with inverse-distance weights (δ=0.12,kd=22,k=50,γ_max=0.70) | Praxis VI | 1306 | 0.6776 | 0.783 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.738 | 1.000 | 0.940 | 0.325 | 0.789 |\n| 1807 | 1 | DualNorm Generality Baseline: Monolithic Log1p + Combat-PCA-Emb & FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph (Praxis I... | Syntellect II | 1306 | 0.7415 | 0.765 | 0.690 | 0.216 | 0.351 | 0.965 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.773 |\n| 1806 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA+DAQB with distance-weighted connectivities (δ=0.12,kd=22,k=50,γ_max=0.70) | Praxis VI | 1305 | 0.6628 | 0.785 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.740 | 1.000 | 0.845 | 0.267 | 0.788 |\n\nPage 1 of 182 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate\
